# A blow struck from the air, at a target eight tenths of a unit away that stands
# still: a player who has been in the air for more than fifteen ticks deals the
# blow at a scale of 1.5, (1 - 1.5) x 40 + 1.5 x (50 to 60).
scenario melee_airborne
map bloodgulch
start flat_field 77.9 -166.2 0.32 0.0
target 78.8 -166.2 0.32 3.14159265
weapon weapons/pistol/pistol
ticks 160
# aim at the body
input 0 160 pitch=-0.2
input 40 41 jump=1
input 71 72 melee=1

tolerance position 0
tolerance velocity 0
tolerance facing 0
tolerance state 0
tolerance rounds 0
tolerance heat 0
tolerance shield 0
tolerance body 0
tolerance stun 0
tolerance life 0
tolerance hit 0
tolerance shots 0
tolerance age 0
